⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
304 calories 44g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins/toppings included)

Brownie Batter Blizzard 😋🍦

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake (350-400ml)
- 20-25g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 10g black cocoa powder
- 10g cocoa powder
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- ½ of a Prime Bites Protein Brownie 
304 cal 25g C, 10g F, 44g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if necessary
5. Top with the chopped up brownie and mix in by hand

